# Keep the build context small and make the image build reproducible: the
# web stage runs `npm ci` inside the container, and a copied-in host
# node_modules (built for glibc, not Alpine) would overwrite it.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/test-results
**/.vite
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
tests/e2e
packaging
casaos
docs
*.deb
*.sha256
